    - rid: 4972360136931147954
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931147955
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ... Hello?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931147956
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 491799c9d5b8c2649bb20546f506fa86, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931147957
    - rid: 4972360136931147958
    - rid: 4972360475574796527
    - rid: 4972360136931147960
    - rid: 4972360136931147963
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, you poor thing...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931147961
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The dog is definitely wounded, with blood coming from his back right
      leg- the cause of the damage not being obvious to Sayori.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931147962
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori slowly approaches the dog...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931147964
    - rid: 4972360136931147965
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: See? I'm here to help you...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931147966
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori extends her hand, which the dog cautiously smells.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Now, let's see if I can't patch you up...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931147967
    - rid: 4972360136931147968
    - rid: 4972360136931147969
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori grabs onto the hurt leg to try and get a better view of the wound-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1bd6accf6dbd3524db9455d6502d5d09, type: 2}
    dialog: Arp-!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931147970
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm sorry, this should take just a second...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931147971
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori focuses on channeling her healing energy into the dog's leg...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931147972
    - rid: 4972360475574796528
    - rid: 4972360136931147974
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796529
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Which heals the wound; the dog perks up almost immediately.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931147976
    - rid: 4972360136931147977
    - rid: 4972360136931147978
    - rid: 4972360136931147979
    - rid: 4972360136931147980
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: There you go, all better!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931147981
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Now if you'll excuse me, I have to get back to finding my friend-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931147982
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The dog stares at Sayori expectantly.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931147983
    - rid: 4972360136931147984
    - rid: 4972360136931147985
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh... what? You hungry-?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The dog walks closer to the shack, turning back toward Sayori.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Hm? Is there something in there?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931147986
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori, deciding to follow the dog, enters the shack...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931147987
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931147988
    - rid: 4972360136931147989
    - rid: 4972360163671146496
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Lying on the bed in the shack is a deceased man.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: He doesn't seem old enough to have died of age, and is slightly miscolored-
      but that could possibly be due to being dead for a while.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Is this your owner?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931147990
    - rid: 4972360136931147997
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The dog, being a dog, doesn't say anything, but does look toward Sayori.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931147995
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Don't look at me like that...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931147991
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I'd love to take care of you, but-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931147992
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: But I don't have a house, a job, <i>and</i> I'm trying to look for my
      friend right now.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931147993
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: So I'm sorry, but...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931147994
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931147998
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Wait a minute...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931147999
    - rid: 4972360136931148000
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori raises the gauntlet she tried to grab {mc} with to her nose...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931148001
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (I <i>think</i> I can smell {mc} on it...?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931148002
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Tell you what, boy. Smell this:'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931148003
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori delivers the potential stink-laden glove to the dog's nose, which
      he does smell.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931148004
    - rid: 4972360136931148005
    - rid: 4972360136931148012
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Can you help me find him?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931148006
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1bd6accf6dbd3524db9455d6502d5d09, type: 2}
    dialog: Woof!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931148007
    - rid: 4972360136931148008
    - rid: 4972360136931148009
    - rid: 4972360136931148010
    - rid: 4972360136931148011
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The dog starts walking off, sniffing the ground as he goes.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931148013
    - rid: 4972360136931148014
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (I guess my new friend's gonna help me find {mc}.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931148015
    - rid: 4972360163671146497
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (I hope he's okay...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931148016
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146498
    - rid: 4972360163671146499
    - rid: 4972360163671146500
    - rid: 4972360163671146501
    - rid: 4972360163671146503
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Hmm... so what should I call you, boy?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146502
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: You've got some serious mutt vibes...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: How about Tramp?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146557
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The dog doesn't really seem to respond to it.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146558
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I guess not.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146559
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146560
    - rid: 4972360163671146561
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Are you kidding me?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146562
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Why are there so many forts?!?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: From atop the fort's walls, a skeleton fires a stray arrow toward Sayori
      and the dog-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146563
    - rid: 4972360475574796530
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Hitting neither, but giving Sayori a spook nonetheless.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146565
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: C'mon boy, let's move!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146564
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146566
    - rid: 4972360163671146568
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: The snow's getting pretty dense now...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146569
    - rid: 4972360163671146570
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Hm? Is that a person out there?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146571
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Further down the road appears to be a silhouette of a man walking toward
      Sayori.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146572
    - rid: 4972360163671146581
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Hello, mister, have you seen a-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146573
    - rid: 4972360163671146574
    - rid: 4972360163671146575
    - rid: 4972360163671146576
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 940308959fccc2947a6b7a45bd7a736f, type: 2}
    dialog: (This girl might do...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 940308959fccc2947a6b7a45bd7a736f, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey, are you going to Morthal, by any chance?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146577
    - rid: 4972360163671146582
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, 'cause I'm looking for-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146578
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 940308959fccc2947a6b7a45bd7a736f, type: 2}
    dialog: Good, good, that's good, uh-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146579
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 940308959fccc2947a6b7a45bd7a736f, type: 2}
    dialog: Listen, I've got urgent business in, uh... Solitude- that's right, Solitude.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146580
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 940308959fccc2947a6b7a45bd7a736f, type: 2}
    dialog: And I only just now remembered that I'm still holding on to something
      I planned on leaving at home-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 940308959fccc2947a6b7a45bd7a736f, type: 2}
    dialog: So, since you're going there anyway, could you take it there for me?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, sure-?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146583
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The man quickly shoves a necklace with an emblem that looks like a double-headed
      axe into Sayori's hands.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146584
    - rid: 4972360163671146585
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 940308959fccc2947a6b7a45bd7a736f, type: 2}
    dialog: Thank you so much!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 940308959fccc2947a6b7a45bd7a736f, type: 2}
    dialog: (Thank the Nine, may Arkay rest her soul...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146586
    - rid: 4972360163671146587
    - rid: 4972360163671146589
    - rid: 4972360163671146590
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Before Sayori can say anything, the man starts running down the road.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: What was that about?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146591
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146592
    - rid: 4972360163671146593
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Crunchy crunch, crunchy snow-!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146594
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Are your paws doing alright, boy?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146595
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1bd6accf6dbd3524db9455d6502d5d09, type: 2}
    dialog: Arf!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146596
    - rid: 4972360163671146597
    - rid: 4972360163671146598
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I'll take that as a yes.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146599
    - rid: 4972360163671146600
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146603
    - rid: 4972360163671146604
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, is that Morthal, right there?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146605
    - rid: 4972360163671146606
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey, boy, where are you going?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146607
    - rid: 4972360163671146608
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: The guard said he thought {mc} was going to Morthal.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146609
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1bd6accf6dbd3524db9455d6502d5d09, type: 2}
    dialog: '?'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146610
    - rid: 4972360163671146611
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, if your nose is taking us that way, we can go after we check out
      Morthal-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146612
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Maybe someone here saw him and could point us in the right direction.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146613
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146614
    - rid: 4972360163671146615
    - rid: 4972360163671146616
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7dc8aed553cafab47b40e0cb21dcd117, type: 2}
    dialog: ... I assure you, you do not need to see the Jarl for this matter-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146617
    - rid: 4972360163671146618
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: Of course I need to see her, we have reason to believe this... <i>village</i>
      is harboring a Talos worshipper, which I'm sure you're aware is a crime.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dbf3b6b38851df4b940cefdd9484f46, type: 2}
    dialog: (Haven't seen a law about that in <i>my</i> books...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: If she has been found to have willingly aided in this treachery, we reserve
      the right to-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dbf3b6b38851df4b940cefdd9484f46, type: 2}
    dialog: Elf, if you have such harsh accusations, you should bring proof.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: Watch your tongue-!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9afaa24472680ad4dabae1ebb2fac8f5, type: 2}
    dialog: The one you are seeking has already fled this land.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dbf3b6b38851df4b940cefdd9484f46, type: 2}
    dialog: My Jarl, you didn't need to-!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9afaa24472680ad4dabae1ebb2fac8f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Clearly, I did. Our... guest was getting antsy.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: So you understand the charges I've made?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9afaa24472680ad4dabae1ebb2fac8f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Indeed, and I'm telling you, you should look west.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: So you won't mind if we investigate every one of your townsfolk?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7dc8aed553cafab47b40e0cb21dcd117, type: 2}
    dialog: Now, there's no need to go that far-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9afaa24472680ad4dabae1ebb2fac8f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Do as you will, you won't find anything.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: Very well, then.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: We'll start with you, girl.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146619
    - rid: 4972360163671146620
    - rid: 4972360163671146621
    - rid: 4972360163671146623
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Huh?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey, get off of me-!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146624
    - rid: 4972360163671146625
    - rid: 4972360163671146631
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, what do we have here?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146626
    - rid: 4972360163671146627
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The Thalmor Justiciar raises the necklace so everyone can see.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: An amulet of Talos. We've found our Talos worshipper.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146628
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Huh? No, that's not mine-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: If you don't mind, Jarl Idgrod, we'll be taking this criminal prisoner.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146629
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9afaa24472680ad4dabae1ebb2fac8f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Even if I wanted to refuse that, this one is not a citizen of my hold.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: That's good enough for us.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: Restrain her.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh no...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: As instructed, the Thalmor soldiers accompanying their Justiciar grabs
      Sayori's arms and tie them together.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: While Sayori doesn't try to put up a fight, the dog does-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796531
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Which promptly gets him kicked away.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796532
    - rid: 4972360163671146633
    - rid: 4972360163671146634
    - rid: 4972360163671146635
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 868c924e69c3f334bb0460b9b886366d, type: 2}
    dialog: Come, we're taking her to Northwatch.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146637
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori's escort to Thalmor jail begins-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Boy, go get {mc}!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146638
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The dog, seeming to understand this instruction, starts heading down
      the path his nose was leading him toward.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360163671146640
    - rid: 4972360163671146641
    - rid: 4972360163671146642
    - rid: 4972360163671146643
    - rid: 4972360163671146644
